# deepsync
===
 DeepSync: a manga, light-novel reader and anime player.  It includes Multi platform where Yugen is the Android app with a  full AniList, MyAnimeList, MangaBaka tracker sync and a Material 3 Expressive design. There is also Shinkai (Linux) and Yomi (Windows)..
